# Fuzzing artifacts — corpus and crash inputs grow large.
# Committed seeds live under fuzz/corpus/<target>/seed/ explicitly.
/fuzz/corpus/*/!(*seed*)
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/target/

# CAS blobs — content-addressed test artifacts. 64-char hex filenames.
[0-9a-f]{64}

